Assets for the widget demonstrator (portable/widget_demo.c).

kick01.bmp .. kick24.bmp
    Animation frames, 160x160, 24 bit uncompressed BMP (the format
    ami_loadpict() reads). Derived from the video
    "Boykickingball-slowmotion-tokyo-20160423.webm" by Nesnad,
    Wikimedia Commons,
    https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Boykickingball-slowmotion-tokyo-20160423.webm
    licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
    Changes: cropped, scaled, and sampled to 24 frames.
    kick01.bmp doubles as the button's resting face.

kick.wav
    The kick sound, 44100 Hz 16 bit mono PCM. Synthesized for this
    demonstrator (a decaying low tone under a short noise transient);
    no license restrictions.
